				{
					"id": 732060402,
					"content": "关于阿凡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732060403,
					"content": "嗯？什么样的问题呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060404,
					"content": "把阿凡遇到的困难告诉了赛芭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732060405,
					"content": "原来如此，所以你来向我求援了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060406,
					"content": "虽然在这种时候你能想起我，对我来说是很荣幸的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060407,
					"content": "不过我毕竟不是专攻物种培育的学者，我的经验也很有限，不能保证一定帮上忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060408,
					"content": "但我会努力试试的，更何况你说的那位培育出新品种蔷薇的先生也让人很感兴趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060409,
					"content": "等我有空的时候就会去阿凡老先生的苗圃，之后去那里找我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7320606,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7320706
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7320603",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7320603,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_NOT_RECEIVE",
						"rawParams": [
							"7320701",
							"1"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿凡"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732060601,
					"content": "沙法卡特叔叔，你最后的一点心愿我没法替你完成了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060602,
						732060609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060602,
					"content": "沙法卡特是谁？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732060603,
					"content": "你们之前不是还缠着我问鬼老头的事吗，其实鬼老头原来也不叫鬼老头，毕竟哪有人真名就叫这个的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060604,
					"content": "听我的长辈说，他原来叫沙法卡特，年轻的时候就从须弥城离开，到了我们村。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060605,
					"content": "他来之后盖了这间小屋一个人住，后来几十年里几乎都没离开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060606,
					"content": "我是没见过他年轻时候的样子，不过据说他那会儿还不怎么讨厌小孩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060607,
					"content": "他家的屋前屋后又种了很多花和树，很多孩子都喜欢往他那里跑，跟他要枣椰吃，听他说话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060608,
					"content": "但我见到他的时候，他已经老了，被人叫作鬼老头，变得讨厌小孩子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060621,
					"content": "一定还有办法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732060622,
					"content": "还能有什么办法呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060623,
					"content": "沙法卡特叔叔…也就是鬼老头，早就安安静静地离开了，要不是这样，我还能去问一问这蔷薇有什么栽种的特殊方法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060624,
					"content": "现在我还能去问谁呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060625,
					"content": "我认识一位生论派的学者赛芭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732060626,
					"content": "哦，你是说那个外来的姑娘啊。她能帮上忙吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060627,
					"content": "再说，她之前路过我这里，被我说了几句给呛跑了。她还会愿意帮忙吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060628,
					"content": "我会试试。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060629
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732060629,
					"content": "你是个很好的孩子，如果找不到能帮忙的人也没关系，有你这些心意就够了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060609,
					"content": "为什么执着于种花呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732060610,
					"content": "我们村里，时不时就会有些外来的人迫不得己，在这里定居。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060611,
					"content": "有的人哪怕一直勉强自己，都始终不能习惯这里的生活，最后孤独一辈子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060612,
					"content": "可能鬼老头…也就是沙法卡特叔叔，算其中之一吧，长期以来，大家都习惯这种事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060613,
					"content": "但不管多少年，我还是不愿意习惯这种事。他实在是太可惜了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060614,
					"content": "他那座小花园你要是看到也会喜欢的，各种颜色的花，还有高高低低的树…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060615,
					"content": "打理出这么一座小花园的人就那么无声无息的不在了，关于他，大家只记得鬼老头会抓走调皮的小孩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060616,
					"content": "我就是不乐意接受这种事，他留下的手记里写了他想让这些蔷薇到处长，我就是想实现他的心愿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060617,
					"content": "反正我这一把年纪，别人怎么看我都无所谓，能做好这件事我就算没有白活。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060618,
					"content": "屋子我给他收拾好了，他留下来的一大堆小册子我也分类整理好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060619,
					"content": "你感兴趣的话，我可以拿一册出来给你瞧瞧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732060620,
					"content": "我就放在<color=#00E1FFFF>屋前</color>吧，让这手记里的他也见见太阳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732060621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7320701,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7320701
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7320701",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7320701,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_COMMON",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿凡"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732070101,
					"content": "你们来了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070102,
					"content": "这位就是你们找来帮忙的人吧，我前几天才刚对她说了难听的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070103,
					"content": "我真是…唉，老糊涂了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070104,
					"content": "我们现在不是在友好地谈天嘛，老先生你别放在心上了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070105,
					"content": "种子发芽了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732070106,
					"content": "很遗憾，我和阿凡老先生都看过了，种子依旧没有发芽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070107,
					"content": "据我观察，这些种子的外部出现了矿石化的现象，之所以会如此，有两种可能原因：",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070108,
					"content": "第一，经过长时间的自然风化，它们失去了生物的活性，正在向化石形态转变。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070109,
					"content": "这种情况下，种子当然是无法发芽的。不过，这种假设成立的可能性较小。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070110,
					"content": "出现化石化现象所需的时间相当长，这些种子不能满足这个时间条件。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070111,
					"content": "第二，这个品种本身具有岩元素亲和力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070112,
					"content": "它们在种子阶段富集了足够的岩元素，在种子外部生成了一层石壳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070113,
					"content": "上述假设成立的话，这就是种子能够长时间保存的基本原理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070114,
					"content": "我…我不是很明白，赛芭小姐是在说种子都变成了石头吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070115,
					"content": "石头啊，果然还是没希望了，石头开不出金蔷薇啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070116,
					"content": "金蔷薇？那个歌谣里的金蔷薇吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070117,
					"content": "哦，你们应该都还不知道吧，村子里流传的蔷薇歌谣，最初就是沙法卡特叔叔编出来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070118,
					"content": "他把自己编的歌谣教给了我的上一辈，他们又把它教给自己的孩子们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070119,
					"content": "我这辈就已经有人不知道这事了，等我这一辈人也不在了，就没人记得他了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070120,
					"content": "「蔷薇啊蔷薇，实现我的愿望。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070121,
					"content": "「花从石头中绽放，金蔷薇对我歌唱。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070122,
					"content": "对啊…我们可以让石头开花！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070123,
					"content": "赛芭想到了什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732070124,
					"content": "就像歌谣里暗示的那样，或许打破了石质外壳，就能让种子从石头中发出芽来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070125,
					"content": "一般来说，栽种植物都需要创造一个理想条件唤醒种子，让它们自己突破种壳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070126,
					"content": "但既然这个蔷薇品种的种子外壳过于坚硬，种芽难以自行突破种壳，我们可以试着从外部帮一帮它们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070127,
					"content": "阿凡老先生，你看可以吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070128,
					"content": "这是要用暴力方法弄碎种子吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿凡"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070129,
					"content": "当然不能把种子完全打碎，我们得让一个灵巧的人去做这件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070130,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，可以拜托你吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070131,
						732070132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070131,
					"content": "果然是我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732070133,
					"content": "过程中一定得小心，先用<color=#00E1FFFF>钝击</color>打破种壳，再用<color=#00E1FFFF>草元素</color>的力量「唤醒」种子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "赛芭"
				},
				{
					"id": 732070132,
					"content": "交给我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732070133
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7320703,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7320703
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7320703",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7320703,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
